# Freehold Shoal (CIPlay freehold_shoal): the landing, the founding board, three plank bundles, the well crank (shows
# the first night's note), a hen for the coop, the first night.
# offset 0 0 is a placeholder: phase 2 sets it from the recipe's save log (PLAY_FORMAT: Coordinates).
island Freehold Shoal
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Freehold
expect hidden firstnight
zone landing
expect step 1
read Freehold founding
expect step 2
openat 2.7 -25.9
openat 16.7 -17.9
openat 26.7 -41.9
expect story plankbundle 3
expect step 3
use wellcrank
expect shown firstnight
expect step 4
catch Chicken 1
expect step 5
zone dune_top
expect step 6
read Old squatter's slate
expect step 7
open Hauled-up van's crate
wait 3
expect step 8
# DEEP 10-24: the notice, the climb, the dive, the founding bell
expect hidden fh_rewchest
use fh_machine
expect hidden fh_rewchest
read Founders' notice
expect step 9
zone fh_trail
expect step 10
# (the ledge cache wants a keycard)
zone fh_summit
expect step 11
expect stand -21.76 -49.76 h=26
open Freehold lookout deck box
wait 3
expect story fh_top 1
expect step 12
zone fh_deep
expect step 13
expect stand -69 0 h=-12
open Squatters' hut strongbox
wait 3
expect story fh_deep 1
expect step 14
use fh_machine
expect shown fh_rewchest
expect story fh_fixed 1
open Founding bell reward
wait 3
read Freehold's charter
expect step 15
read Freehold's first night
expect done
